      "default": "A little care goes a long way"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "closing_heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "Your self-care questions are always welcome."
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "closing_text",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Whether you're building a new routine or simply treating your skin to something special, we're here to make the experience feel easy, enjoyable, and intentional.</p>"
